{"root":{"data":{"id":"dfgewbr9qa00","created":1767591514642,"text":"Godot游戏开发学习笔记"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgex6rhwkw0","created":1767591582136,"text":"节点"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgioiixmns0","created":1767602186902,"text":"游戏的由多种关系紧密的节点，以树状结构构建而成，节点与节点之间有继承和耦合的特性"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dfgis8qjchc0","created":1767602479050,"text":"继承"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgisk6g4m80","created":1767602503957,"text":"子节点继承父节点的特性、功能和属性"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfgisceqqs80","created":1767602487044,"text":"节点功能记录","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgilys26io0","created":1767601987190,"text":"Node2D"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgimag8ops0","created":1767602012596,"text":"基础2D场景功能"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfgivys53c00","created":1767602770836,"text":"Sprite2D"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgixxj9i9s0","created":1767602924851,"text":"显示 2D 纹理的节点。显示的纹理可以是较大图集纹理中的某个区域，也可以是精灵表动画中的某一帧。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfgj0jql29s0","created":1767603129911,"text":"Area2D"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgj0vbl9ko0","created":1767603155126,"text":"2D 空间中的一个区域，能够检测到其他 CollisionObject2D 的进入或退出。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfgjgbvpdqo0","created":1767604366633,"text":"构建场景的位置问题"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgjggt1ry80","created":1767604377356,"text":"1、确保根节点的位置在原点"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dfgjgqz6ef40","created":1767604399495,"text":"2、子节点的位置相对于父节点，父节点移动时会跟随移动。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dfgjhrn4dfc0","created":1767604479307,"text":"3、未实例化前，子节点的位置变化会影响在父节点中的对位置。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfgex78gl080","created":1767591583162,"text":"渲染和更新"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgkjyp5q000","created":1767607472506,"text":"方法"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgkk1j25gg0","created":1767607478667,"text":"_Process(delta)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgkkipwg0w0","created":1767607516086,"text":"通常用于非物理性的渲染和更新，比如标签，"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfgkk1ugb7c0","created":1767607479356,"text":"_PhysicsProcess()"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgkkj1zj000","created":1767607516817,"text":"通常用于物理性的渲染和更新，比如碰撞，受击"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfgklnyncvk0","created":1767607605863,"text":"_Ready"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgklvdc6lc0","created":1767607621989,"text":"用于初始化节点参数，表示节准备就绪"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfgn0tm9ogg0","created":1767614435858,"text":"Input.IsActionPressed(...)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgn2hm7tlc0","created":1767614566462,"text":"当用户在当前帧或物理周期中开始按下动作事件时返回 true。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfgn63rmd0w0","created":1767614849770,"text":"Input.IsActionJustPressed(...)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgn82c8aog0","created":1767615003391,"text":"当用户在当前帧或物理周期中开始按下动作事件时返回 true。只在用户按下按钮的那一帧或周期中为 true。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfgn8qd28i00","created":1767615055684,"text":"Input.IsActionJustPressedByEvent"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgn9eqhy9c0","created":1767615108739,"text":"当用户在当前帧或物理周期中开始按下动作事件，并且在当前帧/物理周期中触发动作按下的第一个事件是 event 时，返回 true。只在用户按下按钮的那一帧或周期中为 true。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfgpd64ymzc0","created":1767621045699,"text":" [Export] public float Speed = 200.0f; //速度"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgpd87n6mo0","created":1767621050215,"text":"在节点外创建一个可以随时调整的属性"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfgkjz5reso0","created":1767607473510,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"snow","version":"1.4.43"}